<programme channel="Cinemax.Hits.us2" start="20261107211500 +0000" stop="20261107231400 +0000">
    <title lang="en">Crazy, Stupid, Love.</title>
    <desc lang="en">Cal Weaver (Steve Carell) is living the American dream. He has a good job, a beautiful house, great children and a beautiful wife, named Emily (Julianne Moore). Cal's seemingly perfect life unravels, however, when he learns that Emily has been unfaithful and wants a divorce. Over 40 and suddenly single, Cal is adrift in the fickle world of dating. Enter, Jacob Palmer (Ryan Gosling), a self-styled player who takes Cal under his wing and teaches him how to be a hit with the ladies.</desc>
    <credits>
      <actor>Steve Carell</actor>
      <actor>Ryan Gosling</actor>
      <actor>Julianne Moore</actor>
      <director>Glenn Ficarra</director>
      <director>John Requa</director>
    </credits>
